{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XzZYtJstzN1794372125.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名56歲男子墮入網上情緣騙案，被騙逾800萬元。</p><p></p><p>警方在守網者社交平台指，一名56歲單身男子，在交友程式收到「白撞」訊息，對方自稱是舞蹈員，期後雙方發展為網上戀人關係。</p><p></p><p>騙徒之後以參加比賽所需的人氣票、會員費，資產審查及行政費等藉口，要求事主多次轉帳，先後轉超過800萬港元，騙徒隨後失聯，事主才發現受騙。</p><p></p><p>警方提醒市民，對「白撞」訊息要保持警剔，亦不要被甜言蜜語沖昏頭腦，進行金錢交易前，與家人和可信任的朋友商量。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.600020+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:18.593203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:42.315190+00:00","content_hash":"a7ce92397dc72b6f74f234e559d86a2c50d2ed0926fffbfb371ba0017617ffed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.600020+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}